先随便抽出一道题，看看别人的解法：

```java
int maxProfit(int[] prices) {
    if(prices.empty()) return 0;
    int s1 = -prices[0], s2 = INT_MIN, s3 = INT_MIN, s4 = INT_MIN;

    for(int i = 1; i < prices.size(); ++i) {            
        s1 = max(s1, -prices[i]);
        s2 = max(s2, s1 + prices[i]);
        s3 = max(s3, s2 - prices[i]);
        s4 = max(s4, s3 + prices[i]);
    }
    return max(0, s4);
}
```

