### A10 ConcurrentHashMap 的组合操作

JDK 21.0.13，Apple M1 Pro。8 个线程同时对同一个键计数，每个线程 10 万次，运行 5 轮：

```java
import java.util.concurrent.*;

public class ChmCount {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        for (int round = 0; round < 5; round++) {
            ConcurrentHashMap<String, Integer> c1 = new ConcurrentHashMap<>(), c2 = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
            Thread[] ts = new Thread[8];
            for (int t = 0; t < 8; t++) {           // 先读再写
                ts[t] = new Thread(() -> { for (int i = 0; i < 100_000; i++) c1.put("k", c1.getOrDefault("k", 0) + 1); });
                ts[t].start();
            }
            for (Thread t : ts) t.join();
            for (int t = 0; t < 8; t++) {           // 一次完成
                ts[t] = new Thread(() -> { for (int i = 0; i < 100_000; i++) c2.merge("k", 1, Integer::sum); });
                ts[t].start();
            }
            for (Thread t : ts) t.join();
            System.out.println("get+put count=" + c1.get("k") + " merge count=" + c2.get("k"));
        }
        ConcurrentHashMap<String, Integer> m = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
        try {                                       // 映射函数中修改同一个 map
            m.computeIfAbsent("a", k -> m.computeIfAbsent("a", x -> 1));
            System.out.println("recursive: ok " + m);
        } catch (Throwable e) {
            System.out.println("recursive: " + e);
        }
    }
}
```

```text
get+put count=173410 merge count=800000
get+put count=94232 merge count=800000
get+put count=157160 merge count=800000
get+put count=278316 merge count=800000
get+put count=114853 merge count=800000
recursive: java.lang.IllegalStateException: Recursive update
```

先读再写可能丢失更新，具体结果取决于线程的交错，换一台机器或者换一种循环写法，数字可能相差很大。

### A11 HashMap 每个条目的内存

JDK 21.0.13（默认开启压缩指针和压缩类指针，对象头 12 字节），Apple M1 Pro，-Xmx2g。每一步之后多次 System.gc()，用 totalMemory - freeMemory 的差值除以条目数：

```java
import java.util.*;

public class HmMem {
    static long used() {
        for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) System.gc();
        Runtime r = Runtime.getRuntime();
        return r.totalMemory() - r.freeMemory();
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int n = 1_000_000;
        String[] keys = new String[n];
        Long[] vals = new Long[n];
        long base = used();
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) keys[i] = String.format("user:%07d", i);       // 12 个字符
        long afterKeys = used();
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) vals[i] = 1_000_000_000L + i;                    // 不在 Long 缓存范围内
        long afterVals = used();
        Map<String, Long> map = new HashMap<>();
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) map.put(keys[i], vals[i]);
        long afterMap = used();
        System.out.printf("键 %.1f 字节/个，Long %.1f 字节/个，HashMap 结构 %.1f 字节/条，合计 %.1f 字节/条%n",
                (afterKeys - base) / (double) n, (afterVals - afterKeys) / (double) n,
                (afterMap - afterVals) / (double) n, (afterMap - base) / (double) n);
        System.out.println(map.size() + " " + keys.length + " " + vals.length);
    }
}
```

```text
键 56.1 字节/个，Long 24.0 字节/个，HashMap 结构 41.5 字节/条，合计 121.6 字节/条
```

运行 3 次结果相同。按对象布局计算（8 字节对齐）：String 对象 24 字节，键只有 ASCII 字符时每个字符占 1 字节（Compact Strings），内部的 byte[] 为 16 + 12 = 28、对齐到 32 字节；Long 为 12 + 8 = 20、对齐到 24 字节；Node 为 12 + 4（hash）+ 3 × 4（三个引用）= 28、对齐到 32 字节；100 万个条目时数组扩到 2²¹ 个桶，每个引用 4 字节，平均每条约 8.4 字节。理论合计约 120.4 字节，实测的 121.6 是堆用量的差值，包含少量其它对象。

